[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_9999","text":"邮件"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0010","text":"“黄金偶像祭最终结果公布通知”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0020","text":"“#Straylight　#芹泽朝日\n　练习中的朝日酱。记舞步超快”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0030","text":"“朝日酱任何时候都是全力以赴\n　从来不会偷懒，大概也偷不了懒。好帅”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0040","text":"……哦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0050","text":"“冬优子酱是个很努力的人\n　舞台上可爱的样子背后，是满满的付出”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0060","text":"“但她不擅长让别人知道这一点\n　觉得她真的很专业”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0070","text":"像这样，还没发出去的那些\n能发的都赶紧发上去吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0080","text":"还能做的事情还有很多吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0090","text":"──然后，就是冬优子酱的宣传视频之类的吧～\n那个啊，超可爱的，票数肯定蹭蹭往上涨──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0100","text":"──嗯？\n你们俩，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0110","text":"──为什么？　你手机里的照片和视频\n不全是冬优我和朝日的吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0120","text":"……爱依酱，你不想赢吗？\n比赛已经无所谓了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0130","text":"……还没结束呢\n组合的人气投票"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0140","text":"我也想赢你们俩。但比起那个──\n我想作为“Straylight”一起赢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0150","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0160","text":"────哇！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0170","text":"喂，制作人\n给我们拍张照"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0180","text":"今天爱依是center～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0016","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0190","text":"拍一张你站在中间的照片发上去\n不这样的话我可不会原谅你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0200","text":"好，要拍咯──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05030000_06_0015","text":"Motion"}]
